<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Mod id="5b1fdc14-91e7-48b2-a078-ed3feefa909c" version="2">
  <Properties>
    <Name>Stormproof Cities（安如磐石）</Name>
    <Description>
    仅限风云变幻。人类和 AI 玩家的所有总督初始都拥有梁的「加固材料」效果。总督就职后，环境效应无法损坏该城市的改良设施、建筑与区域。
    Gathering Storm only. All governors, including those of AI players, start with Liang’s Reinforced Materials effect. Once a governor is established in a city, environmental effects cannot damage that city’s improvements, buildings, or districts.
    </Description>
    <Teaser>
    所有总督就职后，都会保护所在城市的改良设施、建筑与区域免受环境效应损坏。
    All governors protect the improvements, buildings, and districts of their city from environmental damage once established.
    </Teaser>
    <Authors>ApprenTice</Authors>
    <Created>1795622709</Created>
    <AffectsSavedGames>1</AffectsSavedGames>
    <CompatibleVersions>2.0</CompatibleVersions>
    <SupportsSinglePlayer>1</SupportsSinglePlayer>
    <SupportsMultiplayer>1</SupportsMultiplayer>
    <SupportsHotSeat>1</SupportsHotSeat>
  </Properties>

  <ActionCriteria>
    <Criteria id="StormproofCities_GatheringStorm">
      <RuleSetInUse>RULESET_EXPANSION_2</RuleSetInUse>
    </Criteria>
  </ActionCriteria>

  <InGameActions>
    <UpdateDatabase id="StormproofCities_Database" criteria="StormproofCities_GatheringStorm">
      <File>StormproofCities.sql</File>
    </UpdateDatabase>
  </InGameActions>

  <Files>
    <File>StormproofCities.sql</File>
  </Files>
</Mod>
